		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Pale green, covered in sharp scales. Haughty telepathic drakes of the Astral Plane.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 57, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d8) or 1 force breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Force Breath</strong>. A straight line of energy (5' wide) extending double near from dragon. CON 15+ or 4d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapechange</strong>. Assume the form of a humanoid.</p><p></p><p><strong>Telepathic</strong>. Speak mentally with creatures within double near.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
